<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Admin Dashboard - Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        /* Basic Styling for a clean look */
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background-color: #f4f4f9; }
        .navbar { background-color: #333; overflow: hidden; }
        .navbar a { float: left; display: block; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 14px 20px; text-decoration: none; }
        .navbar a:hover { background-color: #575757; }
        .main-content { padding: 20px; }
        .container { background-color: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a>
        <a href="/inventory">Inventory</a>
        <a href="/customers">Customer Forecast</a>
        <a href="/purchasing">Purchasing & Profit</a>
        </nav>

    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Our Portfolio</h1>
            <p>This is where your portfolio content goes. You can add images, project details, and other information here.</p>
            </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
